 name to Walmart Inc. in February 2018. Walmart Inc. was founded in 1945 and is based in Bentonville, Arkansas.", "sector": "Consumer Defensive", "industry": "Discount Stores", "employees": 2100000.0, "city": "Bentonville", "state": "AR", "country": "United States", "price": 132.46, "change_pct": 0.113377035, "quote_time": 1795619721.0, "market_cap": 1050904100864.0, "net_assets": null, "high_52w": 135.16, "low_52w": 102.15, "pe": 50.557255, "forward_pe": 41.054413, "eps": 2.62, "book_value": 12.637, "price_to_book": 10.481918176782465, "dividend_yield": 0.0075, "roce": 0.18099212492427813, "roe": 0.20552999, "roa": 0.06909, "net_margin": 0.02802, "operating_margin": 0.04453, "revenue_growth": 0.052, "earnings_growth": -0.195, "debt_to_equity": 0.7601300000000001, "current_ratio": 0.814, "beta": 0.526}, "financials": {"quarterly": {"columns": ["Jul 2025", "Oct 2025", "Jan 2026", "Apr 2026", "Jul 2026"], "rows": [{"label": "Revenue", "kind": "money", "bold": false, "values": [177402000000.0, 179496000000.0, 190656000000.0, 177751000000.0, 187937000000.0]}, {"label": "Cost of Revenue", "kind": "money", "bold": false, "values": [132771000000.0, 134706000000.0, 143615000000.0, 133058000000.0, 138804000000.0]}, {"label": "Gross Profit", "kind": "money", "bold": true, "values": [44631000000.0, 44790000000.0, 47041000000.0, 44693000000.0, 49133000000.0]}, {"label": "Gross Margin %", "kind": "pct", "bold": false, "values": [0.25158115466567454, 0.24953202299772698, 0.24673233467606578, 0.25143599754713053, 0.261433352666053]}, {"label": "Operating Expenses", "kind": "money", "bold": false, "values": [37345000000.0, 38094000000.0, 38333000000.0, 37200000000.0, 39750000000.0]}, {"label": "Operating Profit", "kind": "money", "bold": true, "values": [7286000000.0, 6696000000.0, 8708000000.0, 7493000000.0, 9383000000.0]}, {"label": "Operating Margin %", "kind": "pct", "bold": false, "values": [0.04107056290233481, 0.03730445246690734, 0.04567388385364216, 0.04215447451772423, 0.